Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我告诉你们 多年后，小学生都会把这个…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm telling you, years from now, school children will study it...{\r}
