Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.55,0:01:49.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}顺利到不可思议{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It was unbelievable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.05,0:01:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们非常的自在 不需要耍心机{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}We could totally be ourselves. We didn't have to play any games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 你打电话给她了吗  - 让她知道我喜欢她 你疯了吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- So have you called her yet? - Let her know I like her? Are you insane?{\r}
