Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.47,0:01:58.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们男生真差劲{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Guys. It's gross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.89,0:02:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}才过一天而已 你要我看起来很黏人吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's the next day. How needy do I wanna seem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.77,0:02:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（编剧：多提·阿布朗）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.48,0:02:03.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我说的对  对吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm right. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.35,0:02:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 吊她胃口 - 是，绝对的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Let her dangle. - Yeah, definitely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.10,0:02:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哦{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.77,0:02:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}真不敢相信我爸妈 给我压力…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I can't believe my parents are pressuring me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.07,0:02:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}要我找你们这种人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...to find one of you people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.36,0:02:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}天啊，直接打个电话吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}God. Come on. Just do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.03,0:02:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}打给她 别摆出一付臭男人的样子{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Call her. Stop being so testosterone-y.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.16,0:02:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对了，旧金山真有这道菜{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Which, by the way, is the real San Francisco treat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.83,0:02:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（导演：彼得邦纳兹）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.33,0:02:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 是机器  - 她的答录机{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- I got her machine. - Her answering machine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不 真有意思 是落叶机清扫机。{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, interestingly enough, her leaf blower picked up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.47,0:02:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那你怎么不留话{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So, um, why didn't you say anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.05,0:02:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不，不，不 上次我毫无准备就留言…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, no, no, no. Last time I left a spontaneous message...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.14,0:02:43.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}结果讲出〝对，的确〞这种蠢话{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...I ended up using the phrase, "Yes, indeed-io."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们看，是瑞秋和巴瑞 大家不要一起回头看{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}MONICA: Look, it's Rachel and Barry. No, no, don't everybody look at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 好啦好啦，是怎么回事  - 他们在讲话{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Okay, okay. What's going on? - Okay, they're just talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.03,0:02:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她看起来有没有很生气{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, well, does he look upset?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他看起来是不是 被狠揍过一顿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Does he look like he was just told to shove anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.03,0:03:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没有，他在微笑{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No. No, actually, he's smiling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.95,0:03:04.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}天啊，不要那样{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, my God. Don't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.41,0:03:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}怎么了 怎么了 怎么了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What? What? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对面有个男人踢了鸽子一脚{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That man across the street just kicked that pigeon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.46,0:03:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哦{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}基本上，提案就是这样成为法案的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And basically, that's how a bill becomes a law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.67,0:03:17.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哦{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}GROUP: Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.30,0:03:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 知道了吗  嘿 瑞秋  - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- See? Hey, Rach. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.93,0:03:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们还好吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}How'd it go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}说真的，感觉还真好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know, it was, uh... It was actually really great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.77,0:03:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他带我去俄国茶坊吃午餐{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Took me to lunch at the Russian Tea Room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我吃的鸡肉，一碰就有奶油流出来{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I had that chicken, you know, where you poke it and butter squirts out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.32,0:03:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}鸟类今天很衰{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Not a good day for birds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}然后我们去逛百货公司{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And then we took a walk to Bendel's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.49,0:03:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我叫他不要买 但他还是买给我一小瓶香奈儿香水{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And I told him not to, but he got me a little bottle of Chanel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}很好，那是你在跟他说…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's nice. Now was that before or after you told him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.04,0:03:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}别再打电话 送花  不要再烦你之前还是之后{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...to stop calling, stop sending you flowers and to generally leave you alone, huh?{\r}
